    "name": "Kruskal2",
    "projectionMode": 1,
    "renderMode": 0,
    "scriptCode": "u_min := 0; u_max := 2*pi;\nv_min := 0; v_max := 3;\nA := 1;       // massa\nB := 0.7;     // ampiezza pulsazione (0..1)\nC := 1;       // velocità pulsazione\n\nU := 0; V := u; W := 0;\ndU := 1; dV := 0; dW := 0;\nConform := 1.0;\n\nfloat M  = A;\nfloat T0 = min(B, 0.95) * sin(C * t);\nfloat K  = U*U - T0*T0;\nfloat r  = solveKruskalR(K, M);\nfloat gXX = (32.0*M*M*M / r) * exp(-r/(2.0*M));\nfloat gpp = r * r;\nreturn mat3(gXX, 0.0, 0.0,\n            0.0, gpp, 0.0,\n            0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n",
